Cross-check chain: a PBH mass M fixes T_V = 1e6 GeV (1e20 g / M)^0.5; f = 1 fixes beta/H given Gamma/H*;
together they fix the hum peak (frequency ~ beta/H * T_V) and the eps that makes Omega_DM/Omega_b = 5.4.
